{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to Combat Master: Battle to DEATH ! a casual soulslike game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can only play Warrior class and the first map in Demo version</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The current Demo version may contain bugs and other issues.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The game is:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combination of Vampire Survivors mechanics and Dark souls combat + mechanics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Souls-like combat with 4 abilities. Usually a buff, 2 damaging skills and an ultimate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Souls-like combat?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game has\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1: Dodge rolling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2: Backstab</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3: Parrying &amp; Riposte (only as a perk on samurai)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4: Stamina bar</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5: Dynamic targeting or lock-on, the good ol white dot on target</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Extra combat related mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1: Sliding</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2: Classic MMO inspired Abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Roguelite mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gain experience by killing mobs and on level up you get to upgrade your stats or gain new perks from a random selection. Each class is completely unique, from skills to weapons and perks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Both game modes spawn mobs endlessely. Try to survive as long as possible or win by killing a boss. Difficulty increases the further you get!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708330/extras/BTD_roguelitemechasndioagip.gif?t=1746715070\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Other Features/Stuff:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\t- Level up system, perks &amp; stat upgrading</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\t- 6 Classes, each with their own unique abilities and upgrade paths</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708330/extras/asdad.gif?t=1746715070\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\t- 8 maps with each having their own enemies and bosses in it</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\t- Steam Achievements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\t- Personal Stats (kills, steps stepped etc.)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\t- Leaderboards for both total kills and boss kills</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\t- 2 game modes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 Campaign:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\t\t\t\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Kill a boss that spawns at 5 minutes to win the match.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\t\t\u00a0 \u00a0 Infinity:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\t\t\t\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 No time limit, try to survive as long as possible.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3708330?t=1746715070","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708330/2a81e3226b5305df1abd10da101052b1087f2e1d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746715070","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708330/46e8e971b4ed9685501470f83ec2e58c096fe3ee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746715070","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708330/46e8e971b4ed9685501470f83ec2e58c096fe3ee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746715070","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Basic fantasy violence and blood"},"detailed